88
00:05:44,300 --> 00:05:47,390
then we only ever take pi of s.

89
00:05:47,390 --> 00:05:52,380
So we would only take
pi of i plus 1 of s.

90
00:05:52,380 --> 00:05:55,590
That would be the only action
we'd ever take in that state.

91
00:05:55,590 --> 00:05:57,370
Because the policy
is deterministic,

92
00:05:57,370 --> 00:05:59,185
it only takes that
one-- that one action.

93
00:05:59,185 --> 00:06:00,810
And so that means
you're just not going

94
00:06:00,810 --> 00:06:03,060
to get any data about what
it would be like to take

95
00:06:03,060 --> 00:06:05,880
other actions in that state.

96
00:06:05,880 --> 00:06:07,620
And so it's useful
to know, because it

97
00:06:07,620 --> 00:06:09,660
