extract through doing policy

284
00:14:17,120 --> 00:14:20,580
improvement, which is
still an e-greedy policy,

285
00:14:20,580 --> 00:14:24,830
is going to be better than
your old e-greedy policy.

286
00:14:24,830 --> 00:14:27,320
And the main idea is just
to say you can kind of also

287
00:14:27,320 --> 00:14:29,083
