1636
01:17:32,220 --> 01:17:34,200
And I think it really
led to a huge excitement

1637
01:17:34,200 --> 01:17:37,380
in how we could couple these
with really impressive function

1638
01:17:37,380 --> 01:17:39,720
approximators.

1639
01:17:39,720 --> 01:17:42,450
So just to summarize, the things
